    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\nWhen the GHL deal closed webhook is triggered, this workflow handles the won deal path:\n\n1. Receives a POST webhook at closed-won\n2. Checks whether the deal status equals won\n3. Sends a Slack alert with client details\n4. Appends a new client record to Google Sheets\n5. Ends the workflow cleanly",
        "height": 344,
        "width": 364,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "d7291ac7-4e5c-4b28-b8a4-ddd7c929f733",
      "name": "Note: Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2464,
        5328
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node-by-node Purpose\n\n1. GHL Deal closed\nReceives a POST webhook at closed-won get client detail and GHL Send contract to client.\n\n2. IF Won Status1\nContinues only when the deal status equals won.\n\n3. Contract Sent Alert\nPosts a Slack alert with client name, phone, and deal status.\n\n4. Add Client Record\nAppends the client details into Google Sheets and sets tracking fields.\n\n5. Process Complete\nEnds the workflow after the record is saved.",
        "height": 356,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "acbf1d39-95cd-4363-aeec-92c26139157d",
      "name": "Note: Node-by-node",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -784,
        5232
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\nWhen the schedule trigger runs, this workflow checks pending contracts and sends the right reminder:\n\n1. Finds rows with pending contract_signed values\n2. Calculates how many hours have passed\n3. Sends a 48-hour or 24-hour reminder, or routes to the stalled queue",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "68b85682-ac23-433b-bc7e-1ba30a5ada40",
      "name": "Note: Overview1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2464,
        5888
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node-by-node Purpose\n\n1. Schedule Trigger\nRuns every 2 seconds.\n\n2. Check Pending Contracts\nReads Sheet1 in the Google Sheet and filters rows where contract_signed is pending.\n\n3. Calculate Hours Passed\nCalculates how many whole hours have passed since start_date.\n\n4. Check Reminder Stage\nSends items into the 48-hour reminder, 24-hour reminder, or stalled queue path based on hoursPassed.\n\n5. Send 48h Reminder\nSends a Gmail message asking the client to schedule a quick call about the unsigned contract.\n\n6. Slack - Notify Contract Still Unsigned\nPosts a Slack alert to the team that the contract is still unsigned after 48 hours.\n\n7. Append 48h Follow-up Record\nUpdates the sheet and sets follow_up_counts to 2.\n\n8. Send 24h Reminder\nSends a Gmail check-in email about the onboarding contract.\n\n9. Append 24h Follow-up Record\nUpdates the sheet and sets follow_up_counts to 1.\n\n10. Notify Stalled Queue\nPosts a Slack alert for manual review when the item falls into the fallback queue.\n\n11. Process Complete1\nEnds the 48-hour path.\n\n12. Process Complete2\nEnds the 24-hour path.\n\n13. Process Complete3\nEnds the stalled queue path.",
        "height": 804,
        "width": 488,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "a96dbffb-87cb-4a30-a588-801527b2103b",
      "name": "Note: Node-by-node1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -208,
        5600
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Overview\nWhen the contract signed webhook is triggered, this workflow handles the onboarding handoff:\n\n1. Receives a POST webhook at the signed contract endpoint\n2. Updates the matching Google Sheets row to completed\n3. Sends a welcome email to the client\n4. Posts a Slack alert so the team can start work",
        "height": 328,
        "width": 300,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "06c4e20c-ae8e-4e48-8d0f-f1fe230bca93",
      "name": "Note: Overview2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2416,
        6288
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Node-by-node Purpose\n\n1. Triggered contract signed\nReceives the signed contract webhook.\n\n2. Check Signed Contract\nUpdates the Google Sheet row and marks contract_check and contract_signed as completed.\n\n3. Send Welcome Email to Client\nSends a welcome email to the client after the contract is signed.\n\n4. Notify Team to Start Work\nPosts a Slack alert so the team can begin the project.\n\n5. Process Complete4\nEnds the workflow after the notification is sent.",
        "height": 388,
        "width": 408,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "f27e1a18-3efa-4de9-a429-3053efba8e61",
      "name": "Note: Node-by-node2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
